  "_note": "Random-init TabDPT fixture (Apache-2.0 architecture, our weights). H is DYNAMIC up to num_features (the wrapper pads to it); y carries train labels only (length=train_size); no cat_mask/d/train_size inputs. ONE safetensors serves BOTH tasks \u2014 TabDPT's single head emits class logits and regression bins side by side, so the two graphs map the same tensors."
